# 行尾统一为 LF（Windows 检出也不转换）：避免 .sh / .ps1 被 CRLF 破坏
* text=auto eol=lf
# 二进制：不做任何转换（曾因把 PNG 当文本导致图片损坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary